 "sentences": [
  {
   "text": "This penny could KILL someone.",
   "t0": 0.147,
   "t1": 2.158
  },
  {
   "text": "Dropped from TWELVE hundred and fifty feet.",
   "t0": 2.4,
   "t1": 4.793
  },
  {
   "text": "Ten miles an hour...",
   "t0": 5.34,
   "t1": 6.338
  },
  {
   "text": "twenty...",
   "t0": 6.7,
   "t1": 7.228
  },
  {
   "text": "TWENTY-FIVE.",
   "t0": 7.675,
   "t1": 8.745
  },
  {
   "text": "With no air, it'd hit at almost TWO HUNDRED miles an hour.",
   "t0": 9.185,
   "t1": 12.762
  },
  {
   "text": "And there's a guy RIGHT under it.",
   "t0": 13.31,
   "t1": 14.877
  },
  {
   "text": "Five hundred feet...",
   "t0": 15.44,
   "t1": 16.4
  },
  {
   "text": "two hundred...",
   "t0": 16.91,
   "t1": 17.668
  },
  {
   "text": "ONE hundred...",
   "t0": 18.25,
   "t1": 19.07
  },
  {
   "text": "Bonk.",
   "t0": 21.073,
   "t1": 21.538
  },
  {
   "text": "It STINGS.",
   "t0": 22.03,
   "t1": 22.965
  },
  {
   "text": "That's it.",
   "t0": 23.275,
   "t1": 23.832
  },
  {
   "text": "It tumbles like a LEAF, so it tops out around twenty-five.",
   "t0": 24.157,
   "t1": 27.275
  },
  {
   "text": "On the real Empire State, wind and the lower ROOFS would stop it first...",
   "t0": 27.712,
   "t1": 31.52
  },
  {
   "text": "but people still swear",
   "t0": 31.965,
   "t1": 33.316
  }
